  <item>
    <title>美国巴勒斯坦同学 向市长提敏感的问题 | 英文对谈 | 20241115</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6736e151f373fe5d4d7b1639</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6736e151f373fe5d4d7b1639</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Nov 2024 06:11:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是Broken Language 不烂舌。我们尝试用不流利的语言沟通不同的文化，增进了解，消除误解。我们勇敢地对话，促进友谊，化解敌意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在2024年11月的这一期英文节目里，我邀请了在美国出生长大的巴勒斯坦裔同学A。10月底，Louisville市长造访我们的大学，同学A在知道市长在加沙问题的立场的情况下，非常勇敢地提出尖锐的问题。这期节目，我们就聊一聊当时提问的细节，同学A是否感受到紧张，挑战政治人物担不担心被秋后算账。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> Challenging the mayor of Louisville</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> Purpose of the mayor's visit to the campus</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> More details about what the student asked</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> Mayor's approaches to update city views when major events are about to take place</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="765">12:45</a> Whether the question was impromptu or prepared</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> Risks of asking sensitive questions to politicians in the public</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> Reflections on the courageous attempt</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> Will you do it again?</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhVTt2u-yax7h9WikMlpp7aquMwX.m4a" length="49841033" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVpI9QxMN_dTKzuQzHOD8-l8xQo.png"/>
