    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是Broken Language 不烂舌。我们尝试用不流利的语言沟通不同的文化，增进了解，消除误解。我们勇敢地对话，促进友谊，化解敌意。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在录制2024年8月的这一期英文节目之前，我和Brice刚看完了一部爱尔兰恐怖片</span><em><span>Oddity</span></em><span>。于是我们以恐怖电影开始，开启了恐怖话题，比如迷信和无法解释的灵异经历带来的恐怖，比如现实生活的惊悚，再比如小时候被同伴和同学霸凌。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 恐怖电影Oddity&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 啥能吓到我们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> Spiritual danger vs danger in real life</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 从 Scream 谈起：从对电影中恐怖的陌生到现在的共情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 中国恐怖电影中的恐怖元素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 不敢看恐怖作品的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 胆小的童年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 生活中的灵异恐怖经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 中美的“市中心”的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 观影后的恐怖残留</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 霸凌</span></p>]]></description>
